instructions:
In package.json, at the text `  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }`: Add a top-level `"bin"` entry alongside the existing `"name"` and `"type"` keys: `"bin": { "todo": "bin/todo.js" }`. Add a `"todo"` script whose value is `"node bin/todo.js"` so the tool can be run inside this project without installing it. Leave the existing `"name"`, `"type"` and `"test"` script untouched.
